Replace pkg_resources, removed in setuptools 82, with importlib.

Backport of https://github.com/deluge-torrent/deluge/pull/501 to 2.2.0,
keeping plugin component names case-preserving (CorePlugin.Label,
WebPlugin.Label) so AutoAdd labels and web UI plugin scripts keep working.

Fixes https://github.com/deluge-torrent/deluge/issues/4003

